</span><a href="#wprm-recipe-container-280393" data-recipe="280393" style="color: #333333;" class="wprm-recipe-jump wprm-recipe-link wprm-jump-to-recipe-shortcode wprm-block-text-normal">Jump to Recipe</a>
</div>
<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><em>Mix things up from the usual marinara sauce and spaghetti with this smoky, creamy, and flavorful <strong>Roasted Red Pepper Pasta</strong>!</em></p><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img decoding="async" width="1707" height="2560" src="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1.jpeg" alt="Roasted Red Pepper Pasta with penne in a bowl, garnished with fresh basil and Parmesan cheese." class="wp-image-280385" srcset="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1.jpeg 1707w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-500x750.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-167x250.jpeg 167w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-40x60.jpeg 40w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-635x952.jpeg 635w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-800x1200.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-1000x1500.jpeg 1000w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/a-roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-1-1-150x225.jpeg 150w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 650px, calc(100vw - 20px)"></figure>
</div><p class="wp-block-paragraph">While fresh tomatoes are often associated with Italy&mdash;used in sauces, salads, and on pizzas&mdash;sweet red bell peppers are also a hugely popular veggie harvested in Italy and enjoyed in Italian cuisine. While raw red bell peppers have a lovely, vibrant flavor, a quick roast at high heat brings out an amazing smoky flavor that makes an incredible base for pasta sauce. Instead of opening the usual jar of store-bought marinara and dumping it into a pan to heat up, tonight take a few extra minutes to make roasted red pepper pasta and enjoy its colorful presentation and zesty flavor.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Not only is roasted red pepper pasta delicious, but it&rsquo;s also easy to make. The oven does most of the work, roasting the pepper slices, onion, and garlic and giving them a slight char on their edges. Once you have your roasted veggies and garlic, it&rsquo;s a matter of dumping them and the rest of the ingredients into your blender. Press a button, and you get a velvety, lovely red-orange sauce. No guesswork! </p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Roasted red pepper pasta is a great dish when you need to mix up your usual pasta game, have a bumper crop of red peppers, or just want a filling, flavorful meatless main dish. The savory, smooth sauce coats the pasta well, and you will want to have some crusty bread handy to sop up any leftover sauce in your bowl&mdash;it&rsquo;s that good!</p><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img decoding="async" width="1707" height="2560" src="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2.jpeg" alt="Ingredients for Roasted Red Pepper Pasta: sliced red peppers, penne pasta, white onion, garlic, half-and-half, tomato paste, dried oregano, and fresh basil." class="wp-image-280386" srcset="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2.jpeg 1707w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-500x750.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-167x250.jpeg 167w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-40x60.jpeg 40w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-635x952.jpeg 635w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-800x1200.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-1000x1500.jpeg 1000w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-ingredients-1-2-150x225.jpeg 150w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 650px, calc(100vw - 20px)"></figure>
</div><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-why-you-will-love-this-recipe">Making this a vegan dish: easy as 1-2-3</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Making roasted red pepper pasta a vegan main dish is easy. Simply substitute the three ingredients that are dairy with your favorite plant-based alternative. Use non-dairy half-and-half (or oat milk), vegan butter, and plant-based grated Parmesan (or nutritional yeast). Those simple swaps make this meatless main a delicious vegan main, with the roasted veggie flavors shining through.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-faqs">How do I store leftovers?</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Store any leftover pasta and sauce separately for best results. Place both into airtight containers and refrigerate for up to 5 days. When ready to serve, reheat the sauce gently on the stovetop on low heat until warm. Toss with the reheated pasta (I like to just spritz with water and reheat the pasta in the microwave) and serve. </p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Additionally, roasted red pepper pasta can be a weeknight supper if you make the sauce portion ahead of time. After step 4, simply place the sauce in an airtight container and refrigerate for up to 5 days. Reheat according to the same instructions above for leftovers.</p><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1707" height="2560" src="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1.jpeg" alt="Roasted Red Pepper Pasta in a red Dutch oven, topped with fresh basil and Parmesan." class="wp-image-280387" srcset="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1.jpeg 1707w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-500x750.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-167x250.jpeg 167w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-40x60.jpeg 40w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-635x952.jpeg 635w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-800x1200.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-1000x1500.jpeg 1000w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-2-1-150x225.jpeg 150w" sizes="auto, (min-width: 768px) 650px, calc(100vw - 20px)"></figure>
</div><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-serving-suggestions">Serving suggestions</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Serve roasted red pepper pasta with a side of crusty bread or breadsticks. Try <a href="https://bakedbree.com/garlic-bread">Garlic Bread</a> or <a href="https://bakedbree.com/olive-garden-breadsticks">Olive Garden Breadsticks</a>. If you want a veggie side as well, consider a fresh, crisp salad or <a href="https://bakedbree.com/air-fryer-asparagus">Air-Fryer Asparagus</a>, which is fast, easy, and fresh. If you want to add meat to roasted red pepper pasta, you can certainly top it with grilled chicken or toss in some chicken meatballs.</p><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1707" height="2560" src="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2.jpeg" alt="Roasted red pepper pasta in a white bowl, garnished with fresh basil and grated Parmesan." class="wp-image-280388" srcset="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2.jpeg 1707w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-500x750.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-167x250.jpeg 167w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-40x60.jpeg 40w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-635x952.jpeg 635w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-800x1200.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-1000x1500.jpeg 1000w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-feature-3-2-150x225.jpeg 150w" sizes="auto, (min-width: 768px) 650px, calc(100vw - 20px)"></figure>
