</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-280393-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Preheat your oven to 450&deg;F and line a baking sheet with parchment paper. Place the red peppers, onion, and garlic on the sheet. Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle kosher salt over the vegetables.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="500" height="750" src="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-500x750.jpeg" class="attachment-medium size-medium entry-image" alt="Roasted Red Pepper Pasta ingredients on a baking sheet." srcset="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-500x750.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-167x250.jpeg 167w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-40x60.jpeg 40w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-635x952.jpeg 635w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-800x1200.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-1000x1500.jpeg 1000w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2-150x225.jpeg 150w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-1-2.jpeg 1707w" sizes="auto, (min-width: 768px) 650px, calc(100vw - 20px)"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-280393-step-0-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Roast the vegetables in the oven for about 25 minutes, or until they are soft and lightly charred.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-280393-step-0-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Boil salted water in a large pot and cook the penne pasta according to the package directions. Reserve 1/4 cup of the pasta water before draining.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-280393-step-0-3" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Place the roasted vegetables in a blender. Add half-and-half, tomato paste, dried oregano, red pepper flakes, and an extra pinch of salt. Blend until the sauce is smooth and creamy.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="500" height="750" src="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-500x750.jpeg" class="attachment-medium size-medium entry-image" alt="Roasted Red Pepper Pasta sauce ingredients in a blender." srcset="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-500x750.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-167x250.jpeg 167w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-40x60.jpeg 40w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-635x952.jpeg 635w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-800x1200.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-1000x1500.jpeg 1000w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4-150x225.jpeg 150w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-4.jpeg 1707w" sizes="auto, (min-width: 768px) 650px, calc(100vw - 20px)"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-280393-step-0-4" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Return the drained pasta to the pot along with the butter. Pour the blended sauce over the pasta and stir over medium-low heat for 3-4 minutes, adding reserved pasta water if needed to achieve the desired consistency.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="500" height="750" src="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-500x750.jpeg" class="attachment-medium size-medium entry-image" alt="Stirring penne pasta with roasted red pepper sauce in a red pot." srcset="https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-500x750.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-167x250.jpeg 167w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-768x1152.jpeg 768w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-1024x1536.jpeg 1024w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-1366x2048.jpeg 1366w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-40x60.jpeg 40w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-635x952.jpeg 635w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-800x1200.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-1000x1500.jpeg 1000w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2-150x225.jpeg 150w, https://cdn.bakedbree.com/uploads/2025/12/roasted_red_pepper_pasta-step-5-2.jpeg 1707w" sizes="auto, (min-width: 768px) 650px, calc(100vw - 20px)"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-280393-step-0-5" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Plate the pasta and finish with a generous sprinkle of grated Parmesan cheese and a sprinkle of basil, if preferred. Enjoy your meal!</div></li></ul></div></div>
